title: runOnce() buffers an entire build log in memory, twice
updated: 2026-08-24T23:37:54Z
---

supervisor.go:258-260 and 275: one bytes.Buffer collects stdout plus stderr with no cap and is returned as a string, doubling it. A full UE package log is tens to hundreds of MB. Callers only ever show the tail -- main.go:409 does tailLines(res.Output, 300) -- so the peak is paid for nothing. Acceptance: the buffer is bounded, for instance by reusing ringBuffer or a head-plus-tail writer.
